  "body": "In https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-csp-list:\r\n\r\n> A [response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response) has an associated **CSP list**, which is a list of [Content Security Policy objects](https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#policy) for the [response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response). The list is empty unless otherwise specified. [[CSP]](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-csp)\r\n\r\nThe link for \"[Content Security Policy objects](https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#policy)\" is broken.",
